msgid ""
"Sans Prometheus Operator : scrape direct via `prometheus.yml` "
"(`static_configs` sur `embewi-core-service:9090`)."
msgstr ""
"Without the Prometheus Operator: direct scrape via `prometheus.yml` "
"(`static_configs` on `embewi-core-service:9090`)."

#: ../../embewi-contract-v2.md:1188
msgid "9. Découpage des responsabilités **[NORMATIF]**"
msgstr "9. Split of responsibilities **[NORMATIVE]**"

#: ../../embewi-contract-v2.md:1212
msgid ""
"Le device reste bête. Toute la complexité « cloud native » (OCI, ORAS, "
"K8s, confiance amont) reste côté Core. C'est le principe de façade "
"appliqué au plan de données."
msgstr ""
"The device stays dumb. All the \"cloud native\" complexity (OCI, ORAS, "
"K8s, upstream trust) stays on the Core side. It's the facade pattern "
"applied to the data plane."

#: ../../embewi-contract-v2.md:1218
msgid "10. Ordre de réalisation (rappel)"
msgstr "10. Build order (reminder)"

#: ../../embewi-contract-v2.md:1248
msgid ""
"**Côté agent : tout le contrat MVP est implémenté.** Côté Core, le "
"runtime minimal (McuNode/McuDeployment/McuConfigMap, pull OCI/ORAS, "
"heartbeat, métriques) l'est également — détail dans `embewi-core-"
"design.md`. Les 6 issues de la dernière revue de contrat (rétention de "
"token, détection `heartbeat.ip`, canal de détresse NTP, découverte de "
"version d'API…) sont **toutes terminées** (Core et agent) — voir `liaison"
"/issues-cross-repo.md`. `McuDeploymentSet` et le webhook de validation "
"sémantique restent hors MVP (Annexe)."
msgstr ""
"**Agent side: the entire MVP contract is implemented.** Core side, the "
"minimal runtime (McuNode/McuDeployment/McuConfigMap, OCI/ORAS pull, "
"heartbeat, metrics) is too — details in `embewi-core-design.md`. The 6 "
"issues from the last contract review (token retention, `heartbeat.ip` "
"detection, NTP distress channel, API version discovery…) are **all "
"done** (Core and agent) — see `liaison/issues-cross-repo.md`. "
"`McuDeploymentSet` and the semantic validation webhook remain out of "
"MVP scope (Appendix)."

#: ../../embewi-contract-v2.md:1259
msgid "Annexe — Hors MVP **[RÉSERVE]**"
msgstr "Appendix — Out of MVP **[RESERVED]**"
